              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wakuu wa Wafilisti wakamkasirikia; nao wakuu wa Wafilisti wakamwambia, Mrudishe huyu, apate kurejea mahali pake ulipomwagiza, wala asiende pamoja nasi vitani, asije akawa adui wetu vitani; kwani mtu huyu angejipatanisha na bwana wake kwa njia gani? Je! Si kwa vichwa vya watu hawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
